{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And on the day the Mishkan was set up.</b> Since he wishes to speak of the journeying of the banners, he tells you the practice of the cloud upon the Mishkan from the day it was erected." "<b>The cloud covered the Mishkan.</b> Over the Mishkan alone there was a distinct and superior cloud, more than those that were for Israel's sake, as stated in the Tanḥuma — and the cloud of the Shekhinah that went upon the camp of the Levites, etc."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:10.638846789Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}